div.p:
Have you seen Pasley’s Essay on our Military Policy? Charles Pasley (1780–1861;
                    DNB), Essay on the Military Policy and Institutions of the British Empire (1810). For Southey’s
                 appraisal see Quarterly Review, 5 (May 1811), 403–437. He is intimate with Coleridge & Wordsworth, & is an extraordinarily able man, as I know by his letters. He is of the right political religion.
